        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "KK.level",
            not_equals: "",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("But will everyone follow me on so perilous an adventure? I am still a youth; it may be they will not trust me."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_26",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mal-Kevek",
            text: _("You may have ended my first life, but you have only made me more powerful in death. Now I will teach you a lesson!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mel Daveth",
            text: _("Leave some of them for me."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dead Knight",
            text: _("Uhhh."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mel Daveth",
            text: _("And him."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("We are surrounded. Look how many there are! How can we defeat them this time?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cylanna",
            text: _("I am afraid we cannot. We need help. My old instructor, Tyegëa, teaches on an island to the north. She and her priestesses are powerful. With their help we could probably defeat these enemies. Our task is to convince her to leave her enclave."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("You can do that, right?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cylanna",
            text: _("I am not sure that I can. However, you could."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("Me? I’ve never even met Tyegëa. How can I convince her to help us if you cannot?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cylanna",
            text: _("You will just have to trust me on this. She will listen to you. I will say no more on the matter."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("Very well. How do we get there?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cylanna",
            text: _("We follow the coast north, then go west to Bilheld Island. Tyegëa lives on a small island to the west of Bilheld, which is over ocean to the west-southwest of Tirigaz. Everyone will have to go; it is now deadly perilous here, and the open ocean west of Tirigaz can be dangerous for small groups."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "KK",
            kill: "no",
            id: "Kai Krellis",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
